cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If Agreemetry supports your research, please cite it as below."
title: "Agreemetry: research adjudication and interrater reliability"
type: software
abstract: >-
  Agreemetry is an open-source web platform for independent judgment by two or more adjudicators,
  transparent resolution of disagreements, and reproducible interrater reliability, with blinding,
  an append-only audit log, analysis-ready exports, lab accounts and an API.
authors:
  - given-names: Taiwo
    family-names: Feyijimi
    alias: tiamole
repository-code: "https://github.com/agreemetry/agreemetry"
url: "https://agreemetry.org"
license: Apache-2.0
version: 1.0.0
keywords:
  - interrater reliability
  - adjudication
  - consensus
  - Cohen's kappa
  - Krippendorff's alpha
  - systematic review screening
  - qualitative coding
  - research software
